More an d more websites now denies to get accessed with our Netscape 4.72 
browser as it is distributed on RH 6.2 on Alpha.

We cannot upgrade to RH 7.1 and get the new ones because the RH 7.1 
installation does not wotk on AS 800.

We cannot install the newer browser versions as they say the RPM number is not 
supported, even if we download only the versions stating they are for RH6.2 on 
Alpha.

So this is a kind of "stuck" situaion:

1. Cannot upgrade to RH7.1
2. Downloadable RPM's for RH 6.2 does not work on RH 6.2

What do you do? Crap Linux and go back to Wintel?

OR patch Netscape somewhere, so it identifies itself with a higher version 
number thus it is accepted. I have heard the latter is doable so it seem the 
simplest, so the question is how?

Hilsen
