be produced. As I understand it RH has asked Compaq for a sum of money (I
beleive $1million) to guarantee further releases. Does anyone think it would
be a good idea to send a letter to someone within Compaq asking them to
support further development of RH for Alpha? Does anyone - Jay? - know who
would be a suitable person to approach concerning such a request?




